::::card{title="Active Incident"}
### Elevated payment latency

Requests remain successful, but payment confirmation is slower than normal in `eu-west-1`.

:::warning
The provider latency threshold has been exceeded for 12 minutes. Automatic failover has not triggered because the error rate remains below 1%.
:::

::kv{Incident="INC-2048" Severity="SEV-2" Commander="A. Rivera" Started="17:41 UTC" NextUpdate="18:10 UTC"}
::::

## Response Plan

1. Confirm provider health and regional network status
  - Compare latency across all availability zones
  - Review the last 30 minutes of provider errors
2. Prepare traffic failover
  - Verify secondary provider capacity
  - Notify the support team
3. Resolve or escalate by the next update window

:::info
Follow progress on the [incident dashboard](https://status.example.com/incidents/INC-2048) or contact :kbd[#operations].
:::

